#
# The SDK's authorize() QUOTES the shared predicate rather than reimplementing it. A local edit
# here would be a second implementation wearing the first one's name, which is the failure the
# whole 1459 consolidation removed: one question, several formulas, disagreeing answers.
#
# PER-FILE PROVENANCE. The closure is vendored at each file's own revision — a single
